    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matchstone is a memory match roguelike deck builder focused on combining various strange and magical stones to score big!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/extras/8e1a6ca6fb4596a542e65603588219b5.poster.avif?t=1754443194\" width=616 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/extras/8e1a6ca6fb4596a542e65603588219b5.webm?t=1754443194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/extras/8e1a6ca6fb4596a542e65603588219b5.mp4?t=1754443194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match similar stones to unlock their powerful effects, but be careful! When stones don't match, you will be a bit closer to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/extras/a459b64ce4addf4575719c3fdda5dbe1.poster.avif?t=1754443194\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/extras/a459b64ce4addf4575719c3fdda5dbe1.webm?t=1754443194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979150/extras/a459b64ce4addf4575719c3fdda5dbe1.mp4?t=1754443194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead and use the shop to purchase what you need for victory. Use booster packs to level up stone classes to match your way to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br>Can you find the source of the stones power?</p>",
